{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/da2f6f96cae703607a587d3a1bcaa7e2.webp?t=1762482199\" width=500 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on down to Kill Cast! The show where the contestants have a chance to win... their lives!! You must blast, dodge and navigate your way through an endless onslaught of mutants! Don\u2019t worry, you will have access to dozens of weapons and power-ups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/47683884fcb8db99e2dd671fc61b9d81.poster.avif?t=1762482199\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/47683884fcb8db99e2dd671fc61b9d81.webm?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/47683884fcb8db99e2dd671fc61b9d81.mp4?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Host will always be serving up an endless array of trap filled rooms and hundreds of enemies who are determined on making sure you do not go home in one piece. The Host will do everything to make sure you don\u2019t leave the studio\u2026 alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/ef64754496008be95cf163203c40abbb.webp?t=1762482199\" width=500 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the next contestant of The Kill Cast Show, the rules are simple: Kill mutants, survive the rounds and cash out before you\u2019re cashed out. Each time you make it back to the studio you are given the chance to cash out and upload your high score or risk it all on another run! But be careful!! If you die, you lose it all!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.poster.avif?t=1762482199\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.webm?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.mp4?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of enemies will pour in from every direction, it is up to you to satisfy the crowd, meet the set kill count and move on to the next arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/6205f868a8c85496b18d7bd676e498ae.webp?t=1762482199\" width=500 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 20 arenas, and each one will test your dexterity and combat ability. Every encounter is different, and every run is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.poster.avif?t=1762482199\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.webm?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.mp4?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons galore!! If you see something, grab it! You never know how it changes the outcome of the battle. Fight for the audience!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.poster.avif?t=1762482199\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.webm?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.mp4?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enough perseverance, maybe you can win.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2940150?t=1762482199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/8a57461374db51e6b413271910a9e6f2b440a802/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762482199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/9bbfadf1eefd19099b08a1215249f4de952d797d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762482199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/9bbfadf1eefd19099b08a1215249f4de952d797d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762482199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains harsh language that some users may take offense to. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_de