 are given the chance to cash out and upload your high score or risk it all on another run! But be careful!! If you die, you lose it all!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.poster.avif?t=1762482199\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.webm?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.mp4?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of enemies will pour in from every direction, it is up to you to satisfy the crowd, meet the set kill count and move on to the next arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/6205f868a8c85496b18d7bd676e498ae.webp?t=1762482199\" width=500 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 20 arenas, and each one will test your dexterity and combat ability. Every encounter is different, and every run is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.poster.avif?t=1762482199\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.webm?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.mp4?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons galore!! If you see something, grab it! You never know how it changes the outcome of the battle. Fight for the audience!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.poster.avif?t=1762482199\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.webm?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.mp4?t=1762482199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enough perseverance, maybe you can win.</p>","developers":["CGBYLG","MonkeyMan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/371979d7cc68ba429e798ecee5d1568670aa44df/header.jpg?t=1762482199","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2940150/953229156/457b73296d26049570949432abf4ca0cdcce2bd4/1761128129/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762482197","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2940150/953229156/457b73296d26049570949432abf4ca0cdcce2bd4/1761128129/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762482197"